# FND-07 manual QA transcript (2026-09-20)

Harness: live scratch PostgreSQL 17 (127.0.0.1:29521, db fnd07_qa, roles per
migrations/roles.sql, alembic 0001_baseline applied, scratch-only uuidv7() SQL
shim kept in /tmp only, never committed). All keyring + secret fixtures lived
under /tmp/opencode/fnd07-scratch and were deleted at teardown.

Drivers:
- product durable worker credential CLI:
  `uv run python -m milpbooklm_workers --command store-credential/dispatch-credential/rotate-credentials/log-canary`
- API via Starlette TestClient over `create_app()` (production wiring, typed
  env config, PG app DSN) - the Secure session cookie is presented explicitly
  (browsers only send Secure cookies over HTTPS, as designed)
- psql as the app role for DB-side proofs

